    "description": "Class III, mains-operated, self-indicating, price-computing, single or dual-interval, non-automatic weighing instruments designed for direct sales to the public. Construction: plastic housing, operator keypad, stainless steel load receptor, operator LCD display, pole-mounted customer LCD display, level indicator, integrated printer. Devices: initial zero setting device, semi-automatic zero setting device, zero tracking device (around Gross or Net zero), zero indicator, net indicator, stable weight indicator, semi-automatic subtractive tare weighing device, gravity compensation, price-computing, totalisation (including non-weighed items), PLU, fixed weight labelling, multi-vendor operation, calibration/set-up mode via sealed internal switch. Interfaces (some optional): RS232C, cash drawer, USB Device, USB Host, RS485, ZigBee, wired LAN, wireless LAN. The instrument may alternatively be fitted with a Preset Tare device, in which case the semi-automatic tare device is a balancing tare device with Tare and Preset Tare values limited to Max."
